{"availability":"available","full":"haydarkozat/btp-genai-orchestration-demo","name":"btp-genai-orchestration-demo","description":"Dual-mode RAG/grounding demo on SAP BTP Generative AI Hub orchestration — the SOUVERÄN-KI pattern re-implemented on SAP. MOCK (offline) + LIVE (gen_ai_hub) behind one LLMBackend protocol.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-10T10:32:16Z","updated":"2026-06-10T12:48:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["generative-ai-hub","grounding","llm","orchestration","python","rag","sap-ai-core","sap-btp"],"demo":"https://www.python.org/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.633Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.633Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.633Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.633Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["I built SOUVERÄN-KI — a self-hosted, open-source enterprise RAG platform (Python, FastAPI, Ollama, Qdrant, LangGraph, Keycloak; 43 tests, green CI). This repo demonstrates the same retrieval-augmented generation / grounding pattern re-implemented on SAP BTP, using the Generative AI Hub orchestration service instead of a self-hosted stack. It is a focused, recruiter-readable proof that the grounding architecture I run on-prem maps cleanly onto SAP's managed GenAI offering.","The demo answers IT-operations questions from a set of \"runbook\" Markdown documents, grounding each answer in retrieved source sections and citing exactly which chunks it used. It runs in two modes behind a single abstraction — fully offline (MOCK, the default) or against the real SAP orchestration service (LIVE)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/haydarkozat/btp-genai-orchestration-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d70eb404eddf9df3c1c7800e44a008a7f03825f5ef88f4fa6a11a061b84ccc21","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.783Z"},"overviewChe